 > Does netbsd support the 21164SX MB and CPU?  It's the OEM from Digital
 > (533MHz).  If it does, has anyone had good luck with the netbsd port to it?

Yes, but you'll need to install NetBSD-current on it, as NetBSD 1.3.2 did
not properly support the core logic chipset and PCI-ISA bridge on that
board.

Also, make sure you have SRM console installed on the board.

